---
// Pro version of the trust strip: sources named, no links out.
---
<section class="rp-trust" aria-label="Where the data comes from">
  <div class="rp-wrap rp-trust-grid">
    <p>
      <strong>Public records, named</strong>
      HM Land Registry, the EPC register, council licence registers and planning portals, ONS and auction catalogues.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Every lead dated and sourced</strong> Each one says where it came from and when.</p>
    <p><strong>No owner names</strong> A property and a public signal, never a person.</p>
    <p><strong>One payment</strong> Passes last 30 days and never renew on their own.</p>
  </div>
</section>
